# warp's per-request benchdata (--full). Deliberately untracked -- NOT an
# oversight; see the note in bench/assemble_result.py before "fixing" this.
# The full matrix produces ~300 MB of it, which would make the contributed-
# results workflow in CONTRIBUTING.md unusable. The derived result JSON,
# the telemetry CSV and the warp log ARE tracked, and each result records the
# benchdata's size and SHA256 so it can still be identified and re-analysed.
results/**/*.benchdata.*
